      "number": 1300,
      "body": "## Token: BRLE\r\n\r\nBRL-pegged yield stablecoin on Base, backed by DI MMF Pulicly traded T+0 funds(~14.4% APY - Brazillian SELIC).\r\n\r\n- **Chain:** Base\r\n- **Address:** 0x7D12a82E335EB2Be0789A33CE2EBF7Eb2bA782F6\r\n- **Decimals:** 18\r\n- **Issuer:** EFIX Securitizadora S.A. — CVM Act 23.635/2025\r\n- **Website:** https://efix.finance/brle\r\n- **Basescan:** https://basescan.org/address/0x7D12a82E335EB2Be0789A33CE2EBF7Eb2bA782F6#code\r\n- **Twitter:** https://x.com/efix_finance\r\n",
